-price divided by 12.
+Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents. The monthly cost of a plan is what it costs
+over a year, divided by 12: a weekly plan is its price × 52 ÷ 12 (€12.00 a week is €52.00 a month), a yearly plan
+is its price ÷ 12. Monthly costs are rounded to the nearest cent (€119.99 a year is €10.00 a month).
 
